    "scenesThatPass": [
      "HELVETICA: Then who? The voices in your head?\nTEACHER: We’re going to continue with our experiments with combustible liquids, so everyone needs to take their seats and be sure to wear eye protect…",
      "TEACHER: If you’re not going to pay attention to the experiment, at least you can make yourself useful and feed the fish.\nHELVETICA: I’ll do it!\nTEACHER: Now to get back to our experiment. Once we introduce the catalyst--",
      "MOM JACKSON: Hm.\nSTACEY: Who’s calling you?",
      "MOM JACKSON: Yes I did. I emailed you, or texted you. Possibly both.\nHELVETICA: Over there!\nMOM JACKSON: Remember our yoga! Eagle pose! Cobra pose! Locust pose! Half- tortoise!",
      "HELVETICA: The idiot threw it. Clear over there somewhere.\nMOM JACKSON: We’re back to our old separate selves."
    ]
